* `body_le6`: the body without the Prop 18 call is `O(T p (log p + 1)^2)`.
* **`cost_final6`**: the Prop 18 call within `C₁₈ · cU6 A₁₈` plus the body and the call is at
  most `(C₁₈ + Kc (x+4)^2) · cU6 (A₁₈ + 2)`.
